            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Ramaco Resources (METC) Is Up 14.0% After Expanding Credit Line And Rare Earths MOU - Has The Bull Case Changed?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "In late December 2025, Ramaco Resources announced a series of moves including expanding its revolving credit facility to US$500 million with KeyBank, authorizing up to US$100 million of share repurchases over 24 months, and signing a rare earth offtake MOU with Mulberry Industries tied to its Brook Mine project. Taken together, these financing, capital return, and rare earth supply-chain initiatives highlight Ramaco\u2019s push to pair greater balance sheet flexibility with a broader role in...",
